kontakion.text:
As is meet, O ye faithful,
let us praise the two wondrous hierarchs,
Germanus and the godly Epiphanius;
for with fire they have utterly consumed the tongues of the ungodly,
setting forth most wise dogmas
for all those who in Orthodox manner//
ever hymn the great mystery of piety.

